In this role as a Full Stack Engineer at Buser, I was one of the main engineers responsible for developing new features and maintaining the B2B dashboard used to manage the company's buses, travels, and financial aspects.

Daily Responsibilities:
- Develop REST API;
- Integrate to external APIs;
- Create E2E and Unitary tests;
- Create frontend applications.

Technologies used:
